# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: the camera raw plug-in for Lumen.
Package: LumenRaw
Section: Graphics
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: Lumen
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-lumen
Description: Camera raw files in Lumen (LibRaw 0.22.3)
 The LumenRaw plug-in lets Lumen open camera raw files from over a
 thousand cameras, using LibRaw 0.22.3. It goes into Lumen's Plugins
 directory, with its own guide.
Build-Map: !Lumen/Plugins/LibRaw -> Apps/Graphics/!Lumen/Plugins/LibRaw
Build-Notice: LumenRaw, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-lumen/releases
 .
 LumenRaw's own code is under the MIT licence. It is linked with LibRaw
 0.22.3, under the GNU LGPL version 2.1; LibRaw's source is on the
 release page (LibRaw-0.22.3-source.zip). The notices follow.
Build-Copyright: !Lumen/Plugins/LibRaw/Licence
